# What `python -m pip install .` -- the command README.md gives -- leaves behind
# in the tree it was run from. Observed during the R208 definition-of-done walk:
# the documented install produced two untracked directories, in a repository
# whose gate reports unattested files. Ordinary Python behaviour, not a tool
# defect, and ignored here so the documented command leaves a clean tree.
build/
*.egg-info/
